OL,3,GNEWSA'System is crumbling', says woman
OL,4,Awhose daughters were murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It actually triggered me. You become
OL,7,Fso angry and frustrated that yet
OL,8,Fanother family is going to have to
OL,9,Fsuffer what we suffered," says Mina
OL,10,FSmallman.
OL,12,FIt is six years since her daughters
OL,13,FBibaa Henry, 46, and Nicole Smallman,
OL,14,F27, were murdered, but it is now
OL,15,Fanother case, which has cost the lives
OL,16,Fof two more women, that has left her
OL,17,F"spiralling".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
