OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'System is crumbling', says woman
OL,4,Awhose daughters were murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Levy, a convicted sex offender,
OL,7,Fmurdered two women, raped a third, and
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted others on London's
OL,9,Fpublic transport after police,
OL,10,Fprosecutors and courts made a series of
OL,11,Fdisastrous decisions that left him free
OL,12,Fto roam the streets.
OL,14,FSmallman says the case shows the "whole
OL,15,Fsystem is crumbling" and is demanding
OL,16,Fcommitments from Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham over how he will keep women
OL,18,Fsafe.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
